<title>POLAND: PEPSICO UPS WEDEL STAKE.</title>
<headline>PEPSICO UPS WEDEL STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pepsico Finance Limited took up all 145,713 shares offered it in a new share issue by Polish confectionery maker E Wedel Zaklady Przeyslu Cukiernicznego SA (Wedel), Wedel said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Before the issue, set at 95.36 zlotys per share, PepsiCo had about 3.9 million of Wedel's 5.8 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
